    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just being overwhelmed though. it's not even a mood. it's like a fundamental truth i've finally seen. everyone else is just pretending there's a reason to keep going, keep building, keep striving, but they're just distracting themselves from the void. once you see how hollow it all is, you can't unsee it. how can anyone find \"value\" in something that has no foundation?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
