    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the \"journey\" and the \"connections\" are just more noise. just more ways to play the game. if the foundation is zero, then every single thing built on top of it is also zero. it feels like i've been tricked into participating in a lie for two decades. if nothing actually matters, then why is everyone so obsessed with staying in the loop? why fight against the obvious?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
